              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Horse archers have a hand weapon and composite bow. Skirmishers. Nomad Cavalry. May have shield (+1). Szeklers have hand weapon and composite bow. May have throwing spear (+3), shield (+1) and light armour (+2). May be Skirmishers and Nomad Cavalry (+9) or formed and have Feigned Flight, Expert Horsemen and Eastern Shock Cavalry (+10) Serbian Hussars have hand weapon, shield and lance. May have light armour (+2) and composite bow (+2).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="11af-51fe-0f8c-2bf8" name="Hand Weapon" hidden="false" targetId="a423-b782-e1ce-43e2" type="profile"/>
          </infoLinks>
